---
description: Secrets and key handling for self-hosted Supabase
globs: **/.env*,**/volumes/functions/**,**/mcp/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- `.env` and `.env.functions` are gitignored — never force-add them
- Mask secret values in chat output
- Frontend may use anon/publishable keys only
- MCP configs must reference env vars, not inline credentials
